WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.565 --> 00:00:02.727
New to Bizpole One?

2
00:00:02.727 --> 00:00:04.181
Here's how to use it,

3
00:00:04.181 --> 00:00:06.443
in eight simple steps.

4
00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:09.094
Click Sign In and enter your email

5
00:00:09.094 --> 00:00:10.859
or phone number.

6
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:12.746
Then type the four-digit code sent to

7
00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:15.053
your email and mobile.

8
00:00:16.565 --> 00:00:19.087
Choose your company at the top.

9
00:00:19.087 --> 00:00:21.575
Your dashboard shows every service and its

10
00:00:21.575 --> 00:00:24.472
status, and the sidebar takes you everywhere

11
00:00:24.472 --> 00:00:25.755
else.

12
00:00:26.531 --> 00:00:28.142
Open Pricing and Plans,

13
00:00:28.142 --> 00:00:29.247
choose your state,

14
00:00:29.247 --> 00:00:31.902
and select the services you need.

15
00:00:31.902 --> 00:00:33.404
Click Proceed to Quote,

16
00:00:33.404 --> 00:00:36.297
then review and approve your quote.

17
00:00:37.065 --> 00:00:39.972
Open My task and pick your service.

18
00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:40.993
Click a task,

19
00:00:40.993 --> 00:00:42.183
upload the file,

20
00:00:42.183 --> 00:00:44.022
and press Submit.

21
00:00:44.022 --> 00:00:46.207
It moves to In review.

22
00:00:46.998 --> 00:00:48.416
To follow progress,

23
00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:51.265
open Orders, then Individual services,

24
00:00:51.265 --> 00:00:53.414
and click View Details.

25
00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:56.332
The timeline shows where things stand.

26
00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:59.646
Finished work appears in the Deliverables tab

27
00:00:59.646 --> 00:01:01.507
under My task.

28
00:01:01.507 --> 00:01:03.815
Your invoices are in Account Settings,

29
00:01:03.815 --> 00:01:05.616
under Invoice.

30
00:01:06.431 --> 00:01:08.306
Before you file a trademark,

31
00:01:08.306 --> 00:01:10.564
open Trademark Search.

32
00:01:10.564 --> 00:01:12.319
Type your brand name or add your

33
00:01:12.319 --> 00:01:14.829
logo, then click Search.

34
00:01:15.765 --> 00:01:18.804
Need help? Open Customer supports,

35
00:01:18.804 --> 00:01:19.946
click New Ticket,

36
00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.220
choose a category,

37
00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:22.157
add a subject,

38
00:01:22.157 --> 00:01:23.875
and submit.

39
00:01:25.098 --> 00:01:28.438
That's it. Everything your business needs,

40
00:01:28.438 --> 00:01:30.204
in one place.

41
00:01:30.204 --> 00:01:33.256
Get started at bizpole.io.
